{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:57:42+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Universe Sandbox", "steam_appid": 230290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universe Sandbox is a realistic physics-based space simulator that allows you to create, destroy, and interact on an unimaginable scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It merges real-time gravity, climate, collision, and material interactions to reveal the beauty of our universe and the fragility of our planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulate Gravity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N-body simulation at almost any speed using Newtonian mechanics. Real science, real physics, no supercomputer required. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.poster.avif?t=1793801004\" width=792 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.webm?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.mp4?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collide Planets &amp; Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic, mind blowing collisions of massive planetary bodies that leave behind molten craters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/ec8847b5d7e975e259ce0b488a0d4b57.avif?t=1793801004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/ec8847b5d7e975e259ce0b488a0d4b57.avif?t=1793801004 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a star, then add a planet. Spruce it up with moons, rings, comets, or even a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.poster.avif?t=1793801004\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.webm?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.mp4?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Model Planetary Climate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch sea ice grow and recede with the seasons because of a planet’s tilt - change the tilt and change the seasons. Or move planets close to a star and see the oceans boil away as the surface heats up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/626fb5eb0d30924f47fa229622c1dcfe.avif?t=1793801004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/626fb5eb0d30924f47fa229622c1dcfe.avif?t=1793801004 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supernova a Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a supernova unfold by colliding two stars, cranking up their mass, or making them explode at your whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/292c1d428fc3ccd9c1cd5c3b1f8666cb.avif?t=1793801004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/292c1d428fc3ccd9c1cd5c3b1f8666cb.avif?t=1793801004 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Historical Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitch a ride with spacecraft including Juno and New Horizons, or view a total solar eclipse.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/dc17de4aaf9ad89d139ecfda19f70579.poster.avif?t=1793801004\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/dc17de4aaf9ad89d139ecfda19f70579.webm?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/dc17de4aaf9ad89d139ecfda19f70579.mp4?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and terraform planets with 12 materials, including water, oxygen, &amp; carbon dioxide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar flares &amp; volatile trails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated planets, stars, &amp; galaxies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulsars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-warping black holes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic space lasers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape oceans &amp; mountains on planet surfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin planets apart with centrifugal force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Macoubre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 20+ languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share &amp; explore simulations on Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/c1a8188a458128fb180cf1ddb94056ab.avif?t=1793801004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/c1a8188a458128fb180cf1ddb94056ab.avif?t=1793801004 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universe Sandbox is a realistic physics-based space simulator that allows you to create, destroy, and interact on an unimaginable scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It merges real-time gravity, climate, collision, and material interactions to reveal the beauty of our universe and the fragility of our planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulate Gravity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N-body simulation at almost any speed using Newtonian mechanics. Real science, real physics, no supercomputer required. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.poster.avif?t=1793801004\" width=792 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.webm?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/4e0bd87bad82313ee47be42b23b34207.mp4?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collide Planets &amp; Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic, mind blowing collisions of massive planetary bodies that leave behind molten craters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/ec8847b5d7e975e259ce0b488a0d4b57.avif?t=1793801004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/ec8847b5d7e975e259ce0b488a0d4b57.avif?t=1793801004 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a star, then add a planet. Spruce it up with moons, rings, comets, or even a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.poster.avif?t=1793801004\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.webm?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/6e4919b2ef96ee1d40ee1131eca2e789.mp4?t=1793801004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Model Planetary Climate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch sea ice grow and recede with the seasons because of a planet’s tilt - change the tilt and change the seasons. Or move planets close to a star and see the oceans boil away as the surface heats up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/626fb5eb0d30924f47fa229622c1dcfe.avif?t=1793801004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras_big/626fb5eb0d30924f47fa229622c1dcfe.avif?t=1793801004 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supernova a Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a supernova unfold by colliding two stars, cranking up their mass, or making them explode at your whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230290/extras/292c1d428fc3cc